| Tool    | Needs Install? | Why                                              |
+---------+----------------+--------------------------------------------------+
| Java    | No             | Set via runtime-versions, image has it           |
| Maven   | No             | Bundled in CodeBuild managed image               |
| kubectl | Yes            | Not part of the image, manually curled           |
+---------+----------------+--------------------------------------------------+

Pre-installed runtimes (activated via runtime-versions, not installed):

• Java (Corretto 8, 11, 17, 21...)
• Python
• Node.js
• Ruby
• PHP
• .NET
• Go
• Android

Bundled with Java runtime (no separate setup):

• Maven ✅ (this is why your mvn clean package just worked)
• Gradle
• Ant

Also baked into the image regardless of runtime-versions:

• Git
• Docker CLI (that's why docker build / docker push work in your buildspec)
• AWS CLI v2
• curl, wget, unzip, tar — standard Linux utilities
• SSM Agent

NOT included — must install yourself:

• kubectl (as you saw)
• helm
• eksctl
• Any niche/custom binaries
