This triggers on any change that lands on main, no matter how it gets there:

+--------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+
| How the change lands on main                                 | Triggers? |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+
| Merging a PR into main                                       | ✅ Yes    |
| Direct git push to main (if allowed)                         | ✅ Yes    |
| Squash-merge or rebase-merge a PR                            | ✅ Yes    |
| A GitHub Actions bot itself pushing to main (e.g., auto-commit) | ✅ Yes |
| Force-push to main                                           | ✅ Yes    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+

